            "get"
          ]
        },
        "description": "## API Catalog Scorecard Severity Guide\n\n### Severity Thresholds (7-day rolling window)\n| Severity | Pass Rate |\n|---|---|\n| CRITICAL | < 50% |\n| HIGH | 50–69% |\n| WARN | 70–89% |\n| HEALTHY | ≥ 90% |\n\n### How to trigger each severity\n- Run the **CRITICAL** folder via a monitor → scorecard shows CRITICAL\n- Run the **HIGH** folder via a monitor → scorecard shows HIGH\n- Run the **WARN** folder via a monitor → scorecard shows WARN\n- Run the **HEALTHY** folder via a monitor → scorecard shows HEALTHY\n\n### Important Notes\n- Only **monitor runs** and **CI/CD runs** (Postman CLI) are ingested by API Catalog.\n- Manual / desktop runs are **not** counted.\n- The workspace must be linked to a system environment in API Catalog settings."
      },
